     "tipo": "dialogo",
     "titulo": "Dialogue: preparing a trip",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "安排「安排旅行与住宿」时，什么细节最容易被忽略？",
       "alumno": "When organising «organising a trip and accommodation», which detail is easy to overlook?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "我们可以先做一个简单的计划。",
       "alumno": "We can start with a simple plan.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "林娜",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "要是中间出了问题怎么办？",
       "alumno": "What if a problem comes up along the way?",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "王明",
        "lengua": "estudio"
       },
       "estudio": "到时候再调整，先把眼前的事情做好。",
       "alumno": "We'll adjust later; first let's do well what's in front of us.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "tipo": "texto",
     "titulo": "Reading: preparing a trip",
     "frases": [
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "安排「安排旅行与住宿」相关的行程时，要同时考虑路线、交通和住宿。",
       "alumno": "When organising «organising a trip and accommodation», you have to consider the route, the transport and the accommodation all at once.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "提前确认信息，可以减少临时改变计划带来的麻烦。",
       "alumno": "Confirming information in advance helps avoid the trouble of last-minute changes to plans.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      },
      {
       "quien": {
        "texto": "",
        "lengua": "alumno"
       },
       "estudio": "如果条件发生变化，原来的决定也可以重新考虑。",
       "alumno": "If circumstances change, the original decision can also be reconsidered.",
       "literal": "",
       "estructura": "",
       "nota": [],
       "analisis": [],
       "parrafo": 0
      }
     ]
    }
   ]
